~ sign
Sign: This doesnt freeze you. Walk to test.
Sign: Cassie does.
=> END

~ jar
do advance_quest("jar")
JAR. Something small inside. It wants out.[if DebugCommands.explain] Quest started. Fairy, tree and shape each take it.[/if]
=> END

~ npc
if is_quest_done("help_cassie")
	=> cassie_ledger
if has_item("showcase_key")
	Cassie: You have my key. Doors behind me.
	=> END
if get_opinion("cassie") < 0
	Cassie: You again. I remember being ignored.
elif get_level_flag("showcase.met")
	Cassie: Back again.
else
	Cassie: Hi. Stay put while we talk.
	do set_level_flag("showcase.met")
Cassie: Help me?
- Help her
	do add_sanity(10)
	do give_item("showcase_key")
	if get_quest_stage("help_cassie") == -1
		do advance_quest("help_cassie")
	do add_opinion("cassie", 1)
	Cassie: Take my key. It opens the door.[if DebugCommands.explain] Sanity +10. Key added. Quest started. Opinion +1.[/if]
- Ignore her
	do add_sanity(-20)
	do add_opinion("cassie", -1)
	Cassie: Fine. Ask again if you change your mind.[if DebugCommands.explain] Sanity -20. Opinion -1.[/if]
=> END

~ cassie_ledger
if get_opinion("cassie") < 0
	Cassie: Doors open. I still remember being ignored.
else
	Cassie: You opened my door.
Cassie: I owe you {{get_favor("cassie")}}.
- Hate. One favor. [if get_favor("cassie") >= 1 /]
	if give_item("aspect_of_hate")
		do add_favor("cassie", -1)
		Cassie: One hate. Favor spent.[if DebugCommands.explain] Reward: item.[/if]
	else
		Cassie: Your hands are full. Keep the favor.
- What does the fairy want? One favor. [if get_favor("cassie") >= 1 /]
	do add_favor("cassie", -1)
	do set_fact("choice.cassie_told")
	Cassie: She collects at the gate. More than she gave. Pay her first.[if DebugCommands.explain] Reward: info.[/if]
- Talk to the fairy for me. One favor. [if get_favor("cassie") >= 1 and get_debt("fairy") >= 1 /]
	do add_favor("cassie", -1)
	do add_debt("fairy", -1)
	do add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	Cassie: Done. She did not like it.[if DebugCommands.explain] Cassie favor -1. Fairy debt -1. Fairy opinion -1.[/if]
- Take this bread. [if has_item("bread") /]
	do remove_item("bread")
	do add_favor("cassie", 1)
	do add_opinion("cassie", 1)
	Cassie: Bread. I owe you 1 more.[if DebugCommands.explain] Repeatable. Bread never runs out.[/if]
- Leave
	Cassie: Door stays open.
=> END

~ door_locked
Locked. Cassie has a key.
=> END

~ door_open
do advance_quest("help_cassie")
do add_favor("cassie", 1)
Unlocked. Cassie saw that.[if DebugCommands.explain] Quest done. Cassie owes you 1. Talk to her.[/if]
=> END

~ chest
ASPECT OF HATE.
=> END

~ tree
if get_debt("tree") > 0
	Tree: You owe me bread.
	- Pay with bread [if has_item("bread") /]
		do remove_item("bread")
		do add_debt("tree", -1)
		do add_opinion("tree", 1)
		Tree: Paid. We are even.[if DebugCommands.explain] Tree debt -1. Opinion +1.[/if]
	- Not yet
		do add_opinion("tree", -1)
		Tree: Roots are patient.[if DebugCommands.explain] Opinion -1. Unpaid: it collects at the last chest.[/if]
	=> END
if is_quest_done("feed_tree")
	Tree: You went through.
	=> END
if get_sanity_zone() == 0
	Tree: Y o u  a r e  f a d i n g.
if get_quest_stage("feed_tree") == -1
	Tree: Im dying. Help me?
	- Yes
		do advance_quest("feed_tree")
		do set_fact("choice.tree_helped")
		do add_opinion("tree", 1)
		Tree: Bread. On the table behind you.[if DebugCommands.explain] Quest started. Opinion +1.[/if]
	- No
		do set_fact("choice.tree_helped", false)
		do add_opinion("tree", -1)
		Tree: Then leave. Ask again if you change your mind.[if DebugCommands.explain] Opinion -1.[/if]
	=> END
if get_quest_stage("feed_tree") == 0
	Tree: Bread. On the table behind you.[if DebugCommands.explain] 3 ways to open the gate: bread, jar, debt.[/if]
	- Give the bread [if has_item("bread") /]
		do remove_item("bread")
		do set_level_flag("showcase.gate_open")
		do advance_quest("feed_tree")
		do add_sanity(20)
		Tree: The gate is open.[if DebugCommands.explain] Bread gone. Sanity +20.[/if]
	- Give the jar [if has_item("jar") /]
		do remove_item("jar")
		do advance_quest("jar")
		do set_fact("choice.jar", "tree")
		do set_level_flag("showcase.gate_open")
		do advance_quest("feed_tree")
		Tree: Small. Loud. Enough. The gate is open.[if DebugCommands.explain] Jar gone. Jar quest done.[/if]
	- Open it now. I will owe you.
		do add_debt("tree", 1)
		do set_level_flag("showcase.gate_open")
		do advance_quest("feed_tree")
		Tree: Open. You owe me bread.[if DebugCommands.explain] Tree debt +1. Pay here with bread.[/if]
	- Nothing for you
		do add_opinion("tree", -1)
		Tree: Hungry too.[if DebugCommands.explain] Opinion -1.[/if]
	=> END
Tree: The gate is open. Go.
=> END

~ loaf
BREAD. Stacks to 5.
=> END

~ pile
3 ASPECT OF HATE. They dont stack.
=> END

~ full
Inventory full.
=> END

~ bread_used
Stale bread. You feel calmer.
=> END

~ gate_locked
Locked. Roots hold it shut. Ask the tree.
=> END

~ gate_open
do advance_quest("feed_tree")
Roots gone. The gate opens.
if get_debt("fairy") > 0
	do add_sanity(-25 * get_debt("fairy"))
	do set_fact("debt.fairy", 0)
	do add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	Fairy: You owe me. I collect now.[if DebugCommands.explain] Sanity -25 per debt. Fairy debt 0. Opinion -1.[/if]
=> END

~ spring
do add_sanity(10)
Water. You feel calmer.[if DebugCommands.explain] Sanity +10. Once.[/if]
=> END

~ final_chest
End of the showcase.
if get_debt("tree") > 0
	do add_sanity(-20 * get_debt("tree"))
	do set_fact("debt.tree", 0)
	do add_opinion("tree", -1)
	Roots under the chest. The tree collects.[if DebugCommands.explain] Sanity -20 per debt. Tree debt 0. Opinion -1.[/if]
if get_favor("fairy") + get_favor("cassie") > 0
	Still owed to you. Fairy {{get_favor("fairy")}}. Cassie {{get_favor("cassie")}}. Go back and spend it.
=> END

~ fairy
if get_fact("choice.nail_kept")
	Fairy: Iron. Stay back. Or hand it over.
	- Hand it over
		do remove_item("iron_nail")
		do set_fact("choice.nail_kept", false)
		do add_opinion("fairy", 1)
		do add_favor("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Late. I owe you 1, not 2.[if DebugCommands.explain] Nail gone. Opinion +1.[/if]
	- Keep it
		do add_opinion("fairy", -1)
		Fairy: Then stay back.[if DebugCommands.explain] Opinion -1. Ask again any time.[/if]
	=> END
if has_item("jar")
	Fairy: That jar. Mine?
	- Give her the jar
		do remove_item("jar")
		do advance_quest("jar")
		do set_fact("choice.jar", "fairy")
		do add_favor("fairy", 1)
		do add_opinion("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Mine. I owe you 1.[if DebugCommands.explain] Jar gone. Jar quest done. Opinion +1.[/if]
	- Open it here
		do remove_item("jar")
		do advance_quest("jar")
		do set_fact("choice.jar", "freed")
		do add_sanity(15)
		do add_opinion("fairy", -1)
		Fairy: It is gone. That was mine.[if DebugCommands.explain] Jar gone. Jar quest done. Sanity +15. Opinion -1.[/if]
	- Not yet
		do set_fact("choice.jar_kept")
		Fairy: I can wait.[if DebugCommands.explain] She asks again while you carry it.[/if]
if is_quest_done("iron_nail")
	=> fairy_ledger
if get_quest_stage("iron_nail") == 1
	if has_item("iron_nail")
		Fairy: Thats the nail. Hand it over?
		- Give the nail
			do remove_item("iron_nail")
			do advance_quest("iron_nail")
			do add_opinion("fairy", 1)
			do add_favor("fairy", 2)
			Fairy: Nail gone. I owe you 2. Talk to me to spend it.[if DebugCommands.explain] Quest done. Opinion +1.[/if]
		- Keep it
			do set_fact("choice.nail_kept")
			do advance_quest("iron_nail")
			do add_opinion("fairy", -2)
			Fairy: Then keep it away from me. I remember this.[if DebugCommands.explain] Quest done. Opinion -2. She still takes it later, for 1.[/if]
	else
		Fairy: No nail on you.
	=> END
if get_quest_stage("iron_nail") == 0
	Fairy: Nail. In the stump, left of the tree. It takes hate.
	=> END
if not get_level_flag("showcase.fairy_met")
	do set_level_flag("showcase.fairy_met")
	Fairy: Where did you come from?
	- I dont remember. [if get_sanity_zone() >= 2 /]
		do add_opinion("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Honest.[if DebugCommands.explain] Needs sanity 50 or more. Opinion +1.[/if]
	- You know where. You sent me here. [if get_sanity_zone() < 2 /]
		do add_opinion("fairy", -1)
		do add_sanity(-5)
		Fairy: I did not.[if DebugCommands.explain] Needs sanity under 50. Opinion -1. Sanity -5.[/if]
	- Not telling.
		do set_fact("choice.fairy_secret")
		Fairy: Fine. I remember that too.
Fairy: Do me a favor? Iron nail in a stump. Pull it out.
- Deal
	do advance_quest("iron_nail")
	do set_level_flag("showcase.nail_wanted")
	do add_opinion("fairy", 1)
	Fairy: Stump is left of the tree. It takes hate.[if DebugCommands.explain] Quest started. Opinion +1.[/if]
- No
	do add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	Fairy: Then nothing back. Ask again if you change your mind.[if DebugCommands.explain] Opinion -1.[/if]
=> END

~ fairy_ledger
if get_opinion("fairy") < 0
	Fairy: You. I give less to people I dont like.
Fairy: I owe you {{get_favor("fairy")}}. You owe me {{get_debt("fairy")}}.
- A truth. One favor. [if get_favor("fairy") >= 1 /]
	do add_favor("fairy", -1)
	Fairy: The shape by the gate is not there when your head is going.[if DebugCommands.explain] Reward: info. Under sanity 50 touching it is safe.[/if]
- Calm. One favor. [if get_favor("fairy") >= 1 /]
	do add_favor("fairy", -1)
	if get_opinion("fairy") < 0
		do add_sanity(10)
		Fairy: Smallest I had.[if DebugCommands.explain] Sanity +10. Opinion under 0 pays less.[/if]
	else
		do add_sanity(15)
		Fairy: Calm.[if DebugCommands.explain] Sanity +15. Opinion under 0 pays 10.[/if]
- Calm now. Pay later. [if get_debt("fairy") < 3 /]
	do add_debt("fairy", 1)
	do add_sanity(20)
	Fairy: Calm. You owe me. I collect at the gate.[if DebugCommands.explain] Sanity +20. Debt +1, up to 3. She takes 25 per debt.[/if]
- Call it even. One favor for one debt. [if get_favor("fairy") >= 1 and get_debt("fairy") >= 1 /]
	do add_favor("fairy", -1)
	do add_debt("fairy", -1)
	do add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	Fairy: One for one. Shame.[if DebugCommands.explain] Opinion -1.[/if]
- Take this hate. [if has_item("aspect_of_hate") /]
	do remove_item("aspect_of_hate")
	if get_debt("fairy") > 0
		do add_debt("fairy", -1)
		Fairy: Hate. I eat it. One debt gone.[if DebugCommands.explain] Hate pays debt first.[/if]
	else
		do add_favor("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Hate. I eat it. I owe you 1 more.[if DebugCommands.explain] Repeatable. Red pile never runs out.[/if]
- Ask me something. [if get_sanity_zone() < 2 and get_fact("choice.fairy_risk", "") != "right" /]
	Fairy: What holds the gate shut?[if DebugCommands.explain] Needs sanity under 50. Right: favor +1, once. Wrong: sanity -15, ask again.[/if]
	- Roots
		do set_fact("choice.fairy_risk", "right")
		do add_favor("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Right. I owe you 1 more.
	- Iron
		do set_fact("choice.fairy_risk", "wrong")
		do add_sanity(-15)
		Fairy: Wrong. Ask again.
	- A key
		do set_fact("choice.fairy_risk", "wrong")
		do add_sanity(-15)
		Fairy: Wrong. Ask again.
- Leave
	Fairy: I remember what is open.
=> END

~ nail
if has_item("iron_nail") or is_quest_done("iron_nail")
	You already took the iron nail.
	=> END
do remove_item("aspect_of_hate")
do give_item("iron_nail")
do advance_quest("iron_nail")
IRON NAIL.[if DebugCommands.explain] 1 ASPECT OF HATE used up. Quest moved on.[/if]
=> END

~ nail_stuck
if not get_level_flag("showcase.nail_wanted")
	Iron nail in a stump. Nobody asked for it.
else
	Stuck. Pulling it takes hate. Red pile has some.
=> END

~ shape
Something stands here. It has your face.
- Back away
	do add_sanity(-10)
	do set_fact("choice.shape", "ran")
	You run. It keeps the face.[if DebugCommands.explain] Sanity -10.[/if]
- Touch it
	do set_fact("choice.shape", "touched")
	if get_sanity_zone() < 2
		Hand goes through. Nothing there.[if DebugCommands.explain] Fake under sanity 50.[/if]
	else
		do add_sanity(-15)
		It bites.[if DebugCommands.explain] Real at sanity 50 or more. Sanity -15.[/if]
- Feed it bread [if has_item("bread") /]
	do remove_item("bread")
	do set_fact("choice.shape", "fed")
	It eats. It leaves.[if DebugCommands.explain] Bread gone.[/if]
- Open the jar at it [if has_item("jar") /]
	do remove_item("jar")
	do advance_quest("jar")
	do set_fact("choice.jar", "shape")
	do set_fact("choice.shape", "jar")
	do add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	It takes what was inside. It leaves. The fairy saw that.[if DebugCommands.explain] Jar gone. Jar quest done. Fairy opinion -1.[/if]
- Call in the fairy. Two favors. [if get_favor("fairy") >= 2 /]
	do add_favor("fairy", -2)
	do set_fact("choice.shape", "favor")
	Fairy: Mine now.[if DebugCommands.explain] Fairy favor -2.[/if]
- Show it the nail [if has_item("iron_nail") /]
	do add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	do set_fact("choice.shape", "iron")
	Iron. It leaves. The fairy saw that.[if DebugCommands.explain] Fairy opinion -1.[/if]
=> END
